  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administration Agreement for the World Bank trust fund for the Public Financial Management Reforms for Institutional Strengthening Projec</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a joint project to strengthen the Liberian institutions in Public Financial Management through a trust fund managed by the World Bank. The Project will improve domestic revenue mobilization systems, and strengthen financial control and accountability in public finances.</narrative>
